## Story Description
Create the project skeleton at /home/bradleyjerome/projects/skyscanner-app. Initialize a TypeScript Node.js project with: package.json (name: skyscanner-app, main: 'dist/server.js', scripts: build='tsc', test='vitest run', start='node dist/server.js', dev='tsx src/server.ts' — src/server.ts is the app's real entry point, built later by the REST API story; do NOT create a src/index.ts or reference dist/index.js anywhere), tsconfig.json (strict mode, target ES2022, module CommonJS, outDir dist/), vitest.config.ts, .gitignore, and a src/ directory. Install runtime dependency express and devDependencies typescript, tsx, vitest, @types/express, @types/node. Do NOT install Skyscanner SDKs — RapidAPI is called directly via fetch. The project must compile cleanly and vitest must exit 0 with no test files present.

